> CREATE FOREIGN TABLE a66_u () SERVER a66_srv OPTIONS (program 'a')
ERROR 42501: permission denied to set the "program" option of a file_fdw foreign table
DETAIL: Only roles with privileges of the "pg_execute_server_program" role may set this option.

> RESET ROLE
-- RESET

> GRANT pg_read_server_files TO a66_fdw_user
